---
description: Project overview and where the shared instructions live
alwaysApply: true
---

- The shared instructions for every AI assistant are in @AGENTS.md (commands,
  conventions, security rules, definition of done). Follow them; do not
  restate or override them here.
- Scoped instructions: @resources/js/AGENTS.md (frontend),
  @tests/e2e/AGENTS.md (Playwright), @database/AGENTS.md (migrations and
  seeders).
- PHP runs in Docker: `docker compose exec -T app ...`. JavaScript tooling
  runs with `npm run ...` (Node 26).
- A change is done only when the "Definition of done" commands in
  AGENTS.md pass. Run them; never claim a result you did not see.
